# ── Private data: never commit ──────────────────────────────
# The app keeps everything in ~/Library/Application Support/I Need A Budget, outside
# this repository. These patterns catch strays: bank exports, databases, backups.
# scripts/hooks/pre-commit blocks them again even if someone uses `git add -f`.
*.csv
*.CSV
*.ofx
*.OFX
*.qfx
*.QFX
*.qbo
*.QBO
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.zip
Personal/
private/
data/
Backups/
Imported Files/
.git-denylist
.env

# Logs
*.log
Logs/

# Build output (scripts/build.sh builds in ~/Library/Caches/I Need A Budget-build)
Application Files/build/
Application Files/dist/
*.app/
dist/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
